      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我照爱丽速子所说的，\n假装不经意地朝后面看了一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c6f4906ac4e12bb0b983e561026612aebc2c73e6266d69d985a1b312be2e73",
